AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_146176> "A 6-methoxy-11-methyl-1,3,4,9,10,10a-hexahydro-2<em>H</em>-10,4a-(epiminoethano)phenanthrene in which the stereocenters at positions 4a, 10 and 10a have <i>R</i>-configuration. It is a prodrug of levorphanol and a strong narcotic analgesic, and listed as a schedule II controlled substance.")
