AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_146243> "A dibenzopyran that is <a href=\"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:66964\" target=\"_blank\">Δ<small><sup>9</small></sup>-tetrahydrocannabinol</a> which is lacking the hydroxy group and in which the pentyl group at position 3 has been replaced by a 1,1-dimethylbutyl group. A potent and highly selective CB<small><sub>2</sub></small> receptor agonist.")
