# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_37532> (phorbol ester)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_37532> "Esters of phorbol, originally found in croton oil (from <em>Croton tiglium</em>, of the family Euphorbiaceae). A number of phorbol esters possess activity as tumour promoters and activate the mechanisms associated with cell growth. Some of these are used in experiments as activators of protein kinase C.")
