AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_45863> "A tetracyclic diterpenoid isolated originally from the bark of the Pacific yew tree, <em>Taxus brevifolia</em>. It is a mitotic inhibitor used in cancer chemotherapy. Note that the use of the former generic name 'taxol' is now limited, as Taxol is a registered trade mark.")
