AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_63633> "An oligopeptide comprising pyroglutamyl, histidyl, tryptophyl, seryl, tyrosyl, <small>D</small>-tryptophyl, leucyl, arginyl, prolyl and glycinamide residues joined in sequence. It is an agonist analogue of gonadotropin-releasing hormone.")
