# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81857> (imazamox)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81857> "A racemate composed of equimolar amounts of (<i>S</i>)- and (<i>R</i>)-imazamox. An inhibitor of acetohydroxyacid synthase, it is used (particularly as the corresponding ammonium salt, known as imazamox-ammonium) as a herbicide for the control of grass, broad-leaf weeds, and pond weed.")
