# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81927> (enilconazole)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81927> "A racemate comprising equimolar amounts of (<i>R</i>)- and (<i>S</i>)-enilconazole. A fungicide used to control a wide range of fungi including <em>Tilletia</em> and <em>Helminthosporium</em> spp. on fruit, vegetables and ornamentals. In veterinary medicine, it is used topically for the treatment of fungal skin infections in cattle, dogs, and horses; it is also used by inhalation for the treatment of aspergillosis in ostriches.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81927> "CHEBI:81927")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81927> "enilconazole")
