AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_90397> "A phenolate anion resulting from the removal of a proton from one of the hydroxy groups of 1-(3,5-dichloro-2,6-dihydroxy-4-methoxyphenyl)hexan-1-one (DIF-1). The major structure at pH 7.3.")
