# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_9997> (pristinamycin IIA)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_9997> "A macrolide that is (together with pristinamycin IA) a component of pristinamycin, an oral streptogramin antibiotic produced by <em>Streptomyces pristinaespiralis</em>. Pristinamycin exhibits bactericidal activity against Gram positive organisms including methicillin-resistant <em>Staphylococcus aureus</em>.")
